{"content":[{"c":["BEBAI (P",{"c":["erson"],"sourceClass":"lc","t":"span"},")"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Ancestor of a family that returned to Jerusalem with Zerubbabel after the exile (",{"href":"?bref=Ezra.2.11","r":"Ezra.2.11","rawR":"Ezra.2.11","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezra.2.11","value":"Ezra.2.11"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ezr 2:11"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Ezra.8.11","r":"Ezra.8.11","rawR":"Ezra.8.11","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezra.8.11","value":"Ezra.8.11"}],"t":"ref","v":"8:11"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Neh.7.16","r":"Neh.7.16","rawR":"Neh.7.16","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.7.16","value":"Neh.7.16"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 7:16"},"). Some of the members of that family were guilty of marrying foreign women (",{"href":"?bref=Ezra.10.28","r":"Ezra.10.28","rawR":"Ezra.10.28","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezra.10.28","value":"Ezra.10.28"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ezr 10:28"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Levitical leader of Israel who signed Ezra’s covenant of faithfulness to God with Nehemiah and others after the exile (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.10.15","r":"Neh.10.15","rawR":"Neh.10.15","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.10.15","value":"Neh.10.15"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 10:15"},"). This individual was perhaps a member of the family of #1 above."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"BebaiPerson","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Ezr 2:11","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ezra.2.11","rawQueryValue":"Ezra.2.11","sourceRefExact":"Ezra.2.11"},{"anchorText":"8:11","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ezra.8.11","rawQueryValue":"Ezra.8.11","sourceRefExact":"Ezra.8.11"},{"anchorText":"Neh 7:16","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.7.16","rawQueryValue":"Neh.7.16","sourceRefExact":"Neh.7.16"},{"anchorText":"Ezr 10:28","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ezra.10.28","rawQueryValue":"Ezra.10.28","sourceRefExact":"Ezra.10.28"},{"anchorText":"Neh 10:15","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.10.15","rawQueryValue":"Neh.10.15","sourceRefExact":"Neh.10.15"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"6a86dc81bbd250e8cb1c92ac563bf2ecbac2316fe48193c85d188b07003e7537","sourceItemName":"BebaiPerson","sourceItemOrder":127,"sourceMember":"Articles/B.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"BebaiPerson","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Bebai (Person)","title":"Bebai (Person)","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}